note right
Contextual-evidence alternative flow details:
A2 Weather unavailable/stale/outside horizon → store explicit status;
A3 Holiday dataset unavailable → calendar evidence unavailable;
A4 Venue unmatched/no eligible history → empty eligible-history result;
A5 Conflict/missing provenance/ineligible item → exclude or flag and reduce confidence;
A6 No eligible incident information → exclude it; absence is not proof of no risk. Weather-data alternatives: invalid location/date; provider error/rate-limit/timeout;
outside forecast horizon; malformed or irrelevant response.
Public-holiday alternatives: invalid local date; dataset read failure;
conflicting jurisdiction/date entries.
Venue-history alternatives: ambiguous venue; no eligible history; unnormalisable outcome;
database query failure.
end note
